# Cloudflare Pages serves static file matches (exact files AND directory
# indexes) before evaluating these rules. Prerendered routes have real
# dist/<route>/index.html files and must NOT appear here — a 200 rewrite
# rule wins over a directory-index lookup, causing the SPA shell to be served
# instead of the prerendered HTML (breaking canonical/title/og tags for
# crawlers). The routes below are pure client-side SPA routes with no
# prerendered file.
#
# Cloudflare Pages only supports 200 (rewrite) and 30x (redirect) here - NOT
# 404, unlike Netlify. Anything NOT listed here AND without a prerendered
# file falls through to dist/404.html for a genuine 404 status.
#
# Targets point at /_index (an extension-less copy of index.html, see
# scripts/prerender.mjs), NOT /index.html: Cloudflare Pages unconditionally
# 308-redirects any *.html path to its extension-less form (documented - see
# "Serving Pages" docs), so a 200 rewrite to /index.html just 308s again on
# top of it. Separately, its _redirects validator false-positives wildcard
# rules targeting "index.html" specifically as an "infinite loop" and drops
# them (github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/11824). An extension-less
# target sidesteps both; _headers sets its Content-Type since Pages can't
# infer one without an extension.

/search           /_index  200
/search/*         /_index  200
/chat             /_index  200
/s/*              /_index  200
/w                /_index  200
/shorts           /_index  200
/tube             /_index  200
/l                /_index  200
/extract          /_index  200
/feed             /_index  200
/feed/callback    /_index  200
# /blog and /blog/* are intentionally NOT here — all blog routes are
# prerendered (dist/blog/index.html + dist/blog/<slug>/index.html).
# Adding them here would cause the 200 rewrite to override the static files.
/creator/*        /_index  200
/green            /_index  200
/feeling-biased   /_index  200
/biased           /_index  200
/osint            /_index  200
/osint/*          /_index  200
/search-portal    /_index  200
/search-results   /_index  200
/results          /_index  200
/auth/*           /_index  200
/onboarding       /_index  200
/settings         /_index  200
/rewards          /_index  200
/revenue-calc     /_index  200
